sule is sustained by Tamai, an energy unique to the land, the same that has brought you to it. You will feel its presence all around, and it will prove essential once you learn how to gather it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115760/extras/945ca86a2af4922abbaea6c176d1bdfc.webp?t=1749547893\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115760/extras/e13ce9711eaee4d49e1737634d2fc0a5.poster.avif?t=1749547893\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115760/extras/e13ce9711eaee4d49e1737634d2fc0a5.webm?t=1749547893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The weight of a prophecy lies on your shoulders, but you don't have to carry it alone. Enjoy Oppidum as a solo adventure, or with up to 3 other players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your friends will be summoned to Insule along with you. Turn this tale into a cooperative adventure to save the land. Venture into the woods, swamps and caves with your friends, collaborate to build your camp and complete quests together. </p>",
